WEBVTT

01:37.590 --> 01:42.900
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.610 --> 01:45.950
[Episode 13]

01:46.200 --> 01:50.120
Our family did not come this far easily.

01:50.470 --> 01:51.789
To stop enduring humiliation,

01:51.789 --> 01:53.789
it has always come down to one thing:

01:54.150 --> 01:55.200
fight.

01:59.150 --> 02:00.070
Old Madam,

02:00.640 --> 02:01.790
Qingyuan...

02:11.520 --> 02:12.520
Qingyuan,

02:13.150 --> 02:14.120
get up.

02:20.840 --> 02:21.910
Now,

02:22.240 --> 02:23.310
I'm asking you—

02:23.960 --> 02:25.680
will you go to tomorrow's

02:25.910 --> 02:29.190
southern opera or not?

02:41.840 --> 02:42.470
I'll go.

02:51.600 --> 02:55.260
♪ In these troubled times, men are
more treacherous than ghosts ♪

02:56.500 --> 03:00.460
♪ None can compare to
your own flesh and blood ♪

03:01.610 --> 03:05.900
♪ It's hard to tell
what's false and what's true ♪

03:06.690 --> 03:07.580
♪ Evil shall meet its due ♪

03:08.360 --> 03:09.740
♪ The vile dog is finally dead ♪

03:10.730 --> 03:13.320
♪ Let me come closer and take a look ♪

03:13.470 --> 03:15.200
My Lady, you're truly amazing.

03:16.070 --> 03:18.190
When Madam Hu discovered the invitation,

03:18.190 --> 03:19.750
I thought we wouldn't be able to come.

03:19.750 --> 03:20.680
I never expected

03:20.750 --> 03:22.070
that you could get Old Madam to personally

03:22.070 --> 03:24.190
approve our coming to watch the opera.

03:24.190 --> 03:25.360
Actually, Grandmother

03:25.360 --> 03:27.590
doesn't want me
to marry Young Master Li either.

03:27.590 --> 03:28.990
It's just that right now,

03:29.150 --> 03:31.680
with Concubine Mei
confined to Liuhua Courtyard,

03:31.680 --> 03:33.750
there's no one managing household affairs,

03:33.750 --> 03:36.360
and for the moment, Grandmother can't
decide who should fill the position.

03:36.360 --> 03:38.070
If Second Sister marries well,

03:38.070 --> 03:39.800
and I am won over by First Madam,

03:41.520 --> 03:42.750
then Grandmother will have

03:42.750 --> 03:44.070
no pawns left to play.

03:47.240 --> 03:48.280
Chunzhi,

03:48.560 --> 03:49.960
let's just enjoy the opera.

03:49.960 --> 03:51.090
Stop looking at her.

03:52.070 --> 03:53.240
That little vixen

03:53.360 --> 03:55.020
was given to Lord Yan long ago.

03:55.270 --> 04:02.260
♪ Today, Yang kills the dog ♪

03:55.360 --> 03:56.190
Second Sister,

03:56.190 --> 03:57.790
don't speak of her like that.

04:03.410 --> 04:20.579
♪ Today, to save my husband
from the prison ♪

04:09.910 --> 04:10.870
Chunzhi,

04:11.680 --> 04:13.080
let's focus on the opera.

04:17.160 --> 04:17.680
Look.

04:19.040 --> 04:21.140
Those two children make such a fine pair.

04:21.140 --> 04:22.220
♪ Madam ♪

04:22.560 --> 04:24.030
♪ Such a huge, vicious dog ♪

04:23.870 --> 04:24.920
Alright, alright.

04:24.860 --> 04:27.410
♪ How did you manage to kill it? ♪

04:27.070 --> 04:28.390
Let's enjoy the opera.

04:27.920 --> 04:28.670
♪ Wu Zhong ♪

04:29.230 --> 04:32.580
♪ Let me tell you the whole story ♪

04:37.950 --> 04:39.830
Madam Hu is really underhanded.

04:40.480 --> 04:42.150
The Heir clearly invited us,

04:42.600 --> 04:45.390
yet she deliberately
seated him beside Second Lady

04:45.390 --> 04:47.040
and put us in the back row.

04:49.190 --> 04:50.250
It doesn't matter.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.480
Just what I wanted.

04:51.830 --> 04:53.890
She's saved me quite a bit of trouble.

04:54.030 --> 04:54.760
♪ Wu Zhong ♪

04:55.450 --> 04:58.640
♪ Let me tell you the whole story ♪

05:04.480 --> 05:06.920
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

05:07.190 --> 05:08.630
That was really good.

05:37.920 --> 05:40.920
Bravo!

05:54.000 --> 05:57.630
I'm Qingyuan, the fourth daughter
of Army Inspector Xie of Hengtang.

05:57.630 --> 05:59.560
I pay my respects to Your Lordship.

06:01.560 --> 06:04.310
You saw everything on the table, right?

06:05.920 --> 06:08.190
I unintentionally offended
Your Lordship that day,

06:08.190 --> 06:10.920
so I made these herbal snacks
especially for Your Lordship as an apology.

06:10.920 --> 06:11.950
I wonder

06:12.510 --> 06:14.440
how Your Lordship finds the taste.

06:14.510 --> 06:16.170
Since they're herbal snacks,

06:17.630 --> 06:18.750
tell me,

06:19.240 --> 06:21.240
what formula did you use?

06:22.040 --> 06:23.390
I decocted astragalus,

06:24.000 --> 06:24.830
codonopsis,

06:25.160 --> 06:25.830
pinellia,

06:26.310 --> 06:27.110
and earthworm

06:27.390 --> 06:28.680
into a broth,
then mixed it into the filling.

06:28.680 --> 06:31.120
Based on the formula
of Blood-Stasis-Expelling Decoction,

06:31.120 --> 06:32.830
this is meant to treat Your Lordship's

06:32.830 --> 06:34.360
lung abscess and heart impediment,

06:34.360 --> 06:35.630
which arise from phlegm and blood stasis

06:35.630 --> 06:38.070
obstructing the collaterals,
stagnant lung qi,

06:38.070 --> 06:40.600
and the resulting failure
of the five organs.

06:48.150 --> 06:50.630
Not even my own son knows

06:51.150 --> 06:54.210
that I suffer from a lung abscess
and heart impediment.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.430
Who

06:56.480 --> 06:58.390
told you

06:58.950 --> 07:00.190
about my illness?

07:00.720 --> 07:02.250
That day, outside the shop,

07:02.720 --> 07:05.630
I noticed
Your Lordship's voice was hoarse,

07:06.040 --> 07:07.630
and your fingers were clubbed.

07:07.630 --> 07:09.310
And it was already late spring,

07:09.310 --> 07:10.870
yet Your Lordship
was still sensitive to the cold

07:10.870 --> 07:12.270
and needed a hand warmer.

07:12.480 --> 07:13.680
These are symptoms of

07:14.720 --> 07:17.050
extreme internal cold and organ failure.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.130
If my guess is right,

07:19.630 --> 07:21.360
Your Lordship didn't
withdraw from the world

07:21.360 --> 07:23.750
because of an eccentric, reclusive nature,
as outsiders claim.

07:23.750 --> 07:25.680
Rather, 5 years ago, Your Lordship

07:26.070 --> 07:27.950
discovered that your old ailments

07:27.950 --> 07:29.160
had built up into a serious illness,

07:29.160 --> 07:30.600
and that is what suddenly changed you.

07:30.600 --> 07:31.430
How dare you!

07:32.920 --> 07:34.310
And from that alone,

07:34.310 --> 07:37.510
you presume to conclude
that I have a terminal illness?

07:40.190 --> 07:40.990
Not only that.

07:41.870 --> 07:44.000
To gain an audience with Your Lordship,

07:44.000 --> 07:45.659
I looked into your whole life.

07:48.390 --> 07:50.750
I know you went to the battlefield
at the age of 14,

07:50.750 --> 07:52.950
suffering 6 stab wounds
while capturing northern invaders.

07:52.950 --> 07:54.190
Despite your grievous wounds,

07:54.190 --> 07:55.560
you killed hundreds of enemies

07:55.560 --> 07:56.680
and held the banner high

07:56.680 --> 07:58.070
as you waited alone for reinforcements.

07:58.070 --> 07:59.630
You were left with injuries
that have never truly healed.

07:59.630 --> 08:01.630
I know that when you sought to
have the Prince of Han named Crown Prince,

08:01.630 --> 08:03.600
you knelt through the night in the snow,

08:03.600 --> 08:05.160
enduring the bone-chilling cold,

08:05.160 --> 08:06.630
and contracted a lung ailment.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.090
I also know that,
to protect the people here,

08:09.310 --> 08:11.950
you've retained command of the troops
while relinquishing political power,

08:11.950 --> 08:13.240
staying shut in for years,

08:13.240 --> 08:14.770
refusing to see outsiders.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.240
Who sent you?

08:31.920 --> 08:32.630
Chunzhi,

08:32.630 --> 08:33.270
look.

08:33.390 --> 08:34.919
He can even do somersaults.

08:38.960 --> 08:39.750
Oh my!

08:44.360 --> 08:45.690
Even if you don't say it,

08:45.750 --> 08:47.000
I know.

08:47.750 --> 08:48.510
It's

08:49.240 --> 08:50.150
Yan Rui.

08:56.960 --> 08:58.910
Since Your Lordship
has already guessed it,

08:58.910 --> 09:00.370
I won't hide it any longer.

09:02.120 --> 09:03.120
You're right.

09:04.000 --> 09:06.120
It was Lord Yan who instructed me that,

09:06.120 --> 09:07.120
no matter what,

09:07.480 --> 09:10.210
I had to find a way
to meet Your Lordship in person.

09:12.840 --> 09:14.080
Lord Yan sent me

09:14.360 --> 09:15.560
to ask you for troops.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.510
All this time, I thought

09:27.480 --> 09:29.280
you'd calculated every move...

09:33.910 --> 09:35.000
in order to

09:35.270 --> 09:36.630
marry my son.

09:37.080 --> 09:38.510
But I never expected...

09:42.670 --> 09:43.910
you'd become a mouthpiece

09:43.910 --> 09:46.220
for a corrupt official

09:47.240 --> 09:49.000
who extorts provisions

09:49.270 --> 09:50.960
and plunders the people's wealth

09:50.960 --> 09:52.200
everywhere he goes.

09:56.910 --> 09:57.770
Your Lordship,

09:58.150 --> 09:59.080
I believe

09:59.360 --> 10:00.240
Lord Yan

10:00.240 --> 10:02.630
isn't the corrupt official
everyone takes him for.

10:02.630 --> 10:03.510
His original aim

10:03.510 --> 10:04.960
is no different from

10:04.960 --> 10:05.910
what you've always stood by,

10:05.910 --> 10:07.770
though your paths are different.

10:08.240 --> 10:09.600
You're done?

10:21.240 --> 10:21.840
Bravo!

10:21.840 --> 10:23.840
Quite a fine performance, isn't it?

10:24.150 --> 10:26.600
First time I've seen
such a fine performance.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.720
Bravo!

10:54.320 --> 10:55.200
I am Yan Rui.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.650
Greetings, Your Lordship.

10:59.510 --> 11:01.370
You've shown yourself after all.

11:01.750 --> 11:04.480
I knew all along
you were here eavesdropping.

11:05.080 --> 11:05.790
One test,

11:06.120 --> 11:07.650
and you revealed yourself.

11:07.670 --> 11:09.670
Your Lordship has been avoiding me,

11:09.720 --> 11:11.850
so I had no choice but to resort to this.

11:12.240 --> 11:13.790
Lord Yan, you

11:13.790 --> 11:15.750
look like an old friend of mine.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.080
Very much alike.

11:23.200 --> 11:23.870
Is that so?

11:25.200 --> 11:27.000
I wonder which old acquaintance

11:27.240 --> 11:30.300
could've left such a deep impression
on Your Lordship.

11:37.550 --> 11:39.080
Hengtang has

11:39.870 --> 11:41.030
long been rotten to the core.

11:41.030 --> 11:42.080
No one can save it.

11:42.720 --> 11:44.320
I concealed my illness

11:44.320 --> 11:47.840
to ensure stability
in Hengtang's military command

11:48.200 --> 11:50.120
and prevent the region
from descending into chaos.

11:50.120 --> 11:52.080
In that way, I suppose I've done

11:52.080 --> 11:54.080
the people of Hengtang one good deed—

11:54.080 --> 11:56.340
at least they won't be left with nothing.

11:56.630 --> 11:57.390
Lord Yan,

11:58.000 --> 12:00.130
what exactly is your purpose in coming

12:00.150 --> 12:01.870
to borrow troops this time?

12:04.870 --> 12:05.870
I came to Hengtang

12:06.440 --> 12:07.720
for only 3 things:

12:09.870 --> 12:10.870
disaster relief,

12:13.030 --> 12:14.230
bandit suppression,

12:15.550 --> 12:17.000
and rooting out corruption.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.530
That's precisely why I have

12:19.240 --> 12:21.300
come to ask Your Lordship for troops.

12:21.960 --> 12:23.790
Why should I trust you?

12:24.360 --> 12:26.120
You have endured your illness
and forced yourself to hold on for years,

12:26.120 --> 12:27.650
refusing to see outsiders,

12:27.750 --> 12:30.210
all to preserve peace throughout Hengtang.

12:30.510 --> 12:32.150
Why not take this opportunity
to completely

12:32.150 --> 12:33.600
uproot
the Jiangnan Transport Commissioner,

12:33.600 --> 12:34.870
the scourge,

12:35.390 --> 12:36.480
once and for all?

12:39.630 --> 12:41.240
You make it sound so easy.

12:41.960 --> 12:43.790
Whether this succeeds or not,

12:43.870 --> 12:45.870
you could simply dust off your robes

12:46.150 --> 12:47.960
and return to the capital to report back.

12:47.960 --> 12:49.000
But what about me?

12:49.670 --> 12:51.120
I'd have to remain here,

12:51.120 --> 12:52.240
clean up your mess,

12:52.600 --> 12:53.870
and pick up the pieces.

12:54.910 --> 12:56.360
You extort grain, hoard wealth,

12:56.360 --> 12:57.670
and prey upon the people.

12:57.670 --> 12:59.530
Who in Hengtang doesn't curse you

12:59.550 --> 13:01.550
as a corrupt official and a villain?

13:03.360 --> 13:05.080
If I kill you here...

13:07.600 --> 13:09.360
I'll face no consequences.

13:09.720 --> 13:11.480
The people will even cheer.

13:11.790 --> 13:13.600
So why wouldn't I?

13:18.320 --> 13:19.200
This man

13:19.270 --> 13:20.480
is truly remarkable.

13:20.790 --> 13:22.720
His Lordship really does have a good eye.

13:22.720 --> 13:23.240
Right?

13:23.240 --> 13:24.600
He performs well, doesn't he?

13:24.600 --> 13:25.440
Chunzhi,

13:24.930 --> 13:27.510
♪ Wu Zhong, come here ♪

13:25.440 --> 13:26.120
look.

13:26.360 --> 13:28.020
Look, someone else is coming.

13:28.490 --> 13:29.200
♪ Come on ♪

13:32.570 --> 13:33.370
♪ Stop pulling ♪

13:34.220 --> 13:34.750
♪ I'm dead ♪

13:40.510 --> 13:41.370
Your Lordship,

13:41.870 --> 13:42.510
I know

13:43.480 --> 13:46.010
you never intended to
kill Qingyuan just now.

13:46.600 --> 13:48.320
It was merely to draw me out.

13:50.870 --> 13:52.200
Now I'm right here.

13:52.960 --> 13:55.290
Your Lordship may do with me
as you please.

13:57.840 --> 14:01.240
But even if Your Lordship kills
one corrupt official like me,

14:02.200 --> 14:04.930
can you kill
every corrupt official in Hengtang?

14:16.630 --> 14:17.490
Your Lordship,

14:17.910 --> 14:19.960
since Lord Yan has come to
borrow troops from you,

14:19.960 --> 14:21.490
he must already have a plan.

14:22.000 --> 14:23.550
You two seek the same goal.

14:23.870 --> 14:25.720
One person alone
may not be able to accomplish it.

14:25.720 --> 14:27.520
But if the two of you join forces,

14:27.550 --> 14:29.750
perhaps victory will be within reach.

14:31.440 --> 14:32.300
Your Lordship,

14:33.480 --> 14:34.410
it all depends on

14:35.270 --> 14:37.670
whether you're willing to take the gamble.

14:52.390 --> 14:53.990
Is everything you said true?

14:54.670 --> 14:55.720
Every word of it.

14:56.030 --> 14:57.320
That vicious girl

14:57.480 --> 15:00.680
left our whole family homeless
and without a livelihood.

15:02.030 --> 15:02.870
Second Madam,

15:03.480 --> 15:05.910
please look at the contents
of this confession letter carefully.

15:05.910 --> 15:08.240
That's more than enough to finish her off.

15:11.670 --> 15:12.510
I know.

15:33.750 --> 15:34.480
Master San,

15:34.960 --> 15:36.160
it's been a long time.

15:36.240 --> 15:37.120
Lord Wei,

15:37.630 --> 15:39.030
got any good business

15:39.200 --> 15:40.270
for us again?

15:40.480 --> 15:42.790
I heard that you previously

15:42.790 --> 15:44.080
looted some government grain

15:44.080 --> 15:45.910
but have been unable to
find a way to sell it.

15:45.910 --> 15:47.910
Now there's a golden opportunity.

15:48.390 --> 15:49.870
On the eighth of next month,

15:49.870 --> 15:51.670
the imperial court
will be collecting grain.

15:51.670 --> 15:53.400
Master San, you have the grain,

15:53.750 --> 15:55.320
and Lord Xie and I

15:55.720 --> 15:57.920
have official channels for selling it.

15:58.120 --> 16:00.750
When the time comes,
you'll only need a few of your men

16:00.750 --> 16:02.210
to pose as grain merchants

16:02.240 --> 16:03.630
and sell the grain separately.

16:03.630 --> 16:05.670
Once the deal is done
and the money is split,

16:05.670 --> 16:07.450
we'll have more wealth

16:07.480 --> 16:09.540
than we could spend in this lifetime.

16:11.200 --> 16:12.400
However, Master San,

16:12.480 --> 16:14.210
there's one more small matter.

16:14.360 --> 16:15.560
Once the deal is done,

16:16.030 --> 16:18.670
you'll need to help me kill someone.

16:20.870 --> 16:22.600
That's just routine business.

16:22.840 --> 16:24.300
What's so hard about that?

16:25.840 --> 16:26.630
Lord Xie,

16:27.200 --> 16:28.390
what do you say?

16:30.270 --> 16:31.150
Lord Wei,

16:32.360 --> 16:34.020
secrecy is the key to success.

16:34.720 --> 16:38.320
You've gathered
this whole pack of vicious criminals.

16:38.630 --> 16:39.870
Once things spiral out of control,

16:39.870 --> 16:41.320
we'll all be doomed.

16:42.030 --> 16:44.750
I'm sorry, but

16:44.960 --> 16:46.480
I cannot participate in this.

16:46.480 --> 16:47.320
Same old rule—

16:47.550 --> 16:49.600
I saw nothing

16:49.960 --> 16:51.440
and know nothing.

16:51.550 --> 16:53.320
You and I have already entered this game—

16:53.320 --> 16:55.510
how can you back out now?

16:55.840 --> 16:56.790
Don't forget

16:57.080 --> 16:58.480
whose side you're on.

17:13.270 --> 17:13.930
Master San,

17:15.400 --> 17:16.920
this is Lord Xie.

17:26.550 --> 17:28.410
The road is slippery. Be careful.

17:29.790 --> 17:30.510
Old Madam,

17:31.070 --> 17:33.750
I really wasn't trying to
find fault with Qingyuan.

17:33.750 --> 17:35.680
It's just that Chuntai
went out on errands today

17:35.680 --> 17:37.790
and happened to run into the shopkeeper.

17:37.790 --> 17:40.400
That's how I found out about
such a serious matter.

17:40.400 --> 17:40.860
Well...

17:41.200 --> 17:43.480
I didn't dare jump to conclusions,

17:44.030 --> 17:45.430
so I troubled you to come.

17:45.920 --> 17:47.240
You must see the witnesses and evidence

17:47.240 --> 17:48.640
with your own eyes

17:48.640 --> 17:51.160
to determine
if this is all a misunderstanding.

17:51.160 --> 17:53.410
Enough with your attempts to sway me.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.790
What I want to see is the evidence!

18:02.510 --> 18:03.240
Old Madam.

18:03.240 --> 18:04.160
Let me go!

18:07.160 --> 18:08.160
Speak.

18:11.550 --> 18:13.640
For these past 10-odd years, Fourth Lady

18:13.640 --> 18:16.750
has been running cons with this woman,
cheating and fleecing people

18:16.750 --> 18:18.080
like shameless rogues.

18:18.920 --> 18:20.120
Don't talk nonsense!

18:20.270 --> 18:22.240
They even committed crimes in Liuzhou

18:22.240 --> 18:23.400
and have a criminal record.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.200
No!

18:24.480 --> 18:25.680
Don't talk nonsense!

18:26.590 --> 18:28.790
They also have an accomplice.

18:29.160 --> 18:30.560
His identity is unknown.

18:31.240 --> 18:32.840
All we know is that he's a man.

18:35.200 --> 18:35.960
Old Madam,

18:36.400 --> 18:38.200
when the shopkeeper
first told me all this,

18:38.200 --> 18:40.030
I was skeptical too.

18:41.210 --> 18:43.240
But when I saw Miss Dong...

18:44.720 --> 18:46.270
Do you still remember her?

18:47.550 --> 18:49.440
The horses that went missing

18:49.880 --> 18:51.550
the day our residence caught fire—

18:51.550 --> 18:53.920
we bought them all from her.

19:01.310 --> 19:02.270
Your Yunduo

19:02.910 --> 19:04.710
was picked out by the Xie family.

19:05.110 --> 19:06.280
This afternoon,

19:06.960 --> 19:08.890
it was taken into the Xie Residence

19:09.110 --> 19:10.640
with several other horses.

19:17.510 --> 19:20.830
And now, Qingyuan has hired
this very woman

19:20.830 --> 19:23.070
as the new shopkeeper of her business.

19:24.550 --> 19:25.640
Old Madam,

19:25.920 --> 19:26.480
well...

19:27.790 --> 19:28.240
I...

19:28.510 --> 19:28.960
Well,

19:29.160 --> 19:31.360
I really can't say for certain anymore.

19:31.480 --> 19:32.520
I don't know

19:33.030 --> 19:35.630
if Qingyuan planted spies long ago

19:35.790 --> 19:37.110
in our household

19:37.550 --> 19:38.920
or if there are

19:39.030 --> 19:40.400
really

19:40.680 --> 19:42.480
such coincidences in the world.

19:48.750 --> 19:49.640
Old Madam,

19:49.640 --> 19:50.440
Old Madam,

19:50.550 --> 19:52.270
you must give me justice!

19:52.310 --> 19:54.270
Every word I've said is true!

19:55.590 --> 19:56.590
This confession letter

19:56.590 --> 19:57.520
is the evidence.

20:04.900 --> 20:07.080
[Confession Letter—Maping County, Liuzhou]

20:09.030 --> 20:09.590
That day,

20:10.200 --> 20:12.180
I found out

20:12.310 --> 20:15.460
that Fourth Lady was a fraud...

20:16.440 --> 20:17.000
What did you say?

20:17.000 --> 20:17.680
And

20:18.030 --> 20:20.110
she wasn't of
the Xie family bloodline at all.

20:20.110 --> 20:22.230
[Jin Yunya] [Dong Fangchun]

20:20.310 --> 20:22.110
Then she drove me out of the shop!

20:22.240 --> 20:22.920
Old Madam,

20:23.110 --> 20:24.640
you must give me justice!

20:25.590 --> 20:27.250
Don't listen to his nonsense!

20:27.550 --> 20:28.550
Old Madam,

20:29.000 --> 20:31.060
I know this may be unpleasant to hear,

20:31.400 --> 20:32.890
but I said it long ago.

20:33.480 --> 20:34.510
Qingyuan

20:34.950 --> 20:36.690
has always been a Chen.

20:37.030 --> 20:38.830
She's never truly been one of us.

20:39.510 --> 20:40.760
Now it seems

20:40.830 --> 20:43.480
she's a fraud through and through.

20:44.680 --> 20:48.280
She doesn't even count as a real member
of the decent Chen family.

20:50.270 --> 20:51.480
Well.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.240
Very well.

20:55.640 --> 20:59.680
What a scheming Fourth Lady!

21:07.640 --> 21:08.510
My Lady,

21:10.000 --> 21:11.560
everyone is waiting.

21:14.160 --> 21:16.420
From the day I set foot in this household,

21:18.030 --> 21:19.160
I knew

21:20.440 --> 21:21.640
this day would come.

21:23.750 --> 21:25.210
I just didn't expect it...

21:27.830 --> 21:28.960
to come so soon.

21:29.960 --> 21:32.110
We can't blame anyone else for this.

21:32.270 --> 21:33.440
Who would've thought

21:33.440 --> 21:35.500
that the Fourth Lady in our household

21:35.550 --> 21:37.830
was an impostor trying to swindle money

21:37.830 --> 21:38.960
from our family?

21:39.680 --> 21:42.310
It's just a pity that our real child

21:43.000 --> 21:45.830
died in a fire many years ago.

21:48.160 --> 21:48.790
Master,

21:49.590 --> 21:52.480
if Qingyuan is indeed an impostor,

21:53.200 --> 21:54.920
what should we do with her?

21:55.160 --> 21:56.790
What is there to decide?

21:56.790 --> 21:58.550
Drive the fraud out, of course.

22:01.240 --> 22:02.570
We'll do as Master says.

22:05.310 --> 22:06.920
Fourth Lady has arrived!

22:22.880 --> 22:23.640
Father,

22:24.270 --> 22:25.070
Grandmother,

22:25.510 --> 22:27.960
may I ask why you summoned me today?

22:28.350 --> 22:29.240
Qingyuan,

22:30.160 --> 22:31.720
do you know her?

22:37.000 --> 22:38.000
Fangchun?

22:39.750 --> 22:40.550
Grandmother,

22:40.790 --> 22:43.590
why have you had
my dear friend tied up here?

22:44.680 --> 22:45.680
Show it to her.

22:52.260 --> 22:53.530
[Confession Letter—Maping County, Liuzhou]

22:52.310 --> 22:55.480
Now, someone has just come forward
testifying against you,

22:55.480 --> 22:57.080
saying that you and Miss Dong

22:57.400 --> 23:00.240
swindled and cheated people together
in Liuzhou as children,

22:59.530 --> 23:01.820
[Confession Letter—Maping County, Liuzhou]

23:00.830 --> 23:05.200
and that after growing up,
you schemed your way into our household.

23:05.550 --> 23:06.640
Is that true?

23:11.680 --> 23:12.480
Grandmother,

23:12.680 --> 23:13.310
Father,

23:14.200 --> 23:17.590
I grew up with Fangchun.

23:17.960 --> 23:19.400
But I don't understand

23:19.680 --> 23:22.170
what's wrong with that.

23:22.960 --> 23:24.750
I lost my mother when I was very young,

23:24.750 --> 23:25.920
and I had no home.

23:26.550 --> 23:28.440
If Fangchun hadn't helped me,

23:28.750 --> 23:30.220
I might have died long ago.

23:32.070 --> 23:33.650
That wasn't her fault.

23:33.960 --> 23:35.960
If you must blame someone, blame me.

23:36.440 --> 23:38.970
Blame me for having no one
willing to take me in

23:39.310 --> 23:41.710
when I was wandering
the streets back then.

23:44.200 --> 23:48.070
I was on my own from a young age.

23:48.920 --> 23:51.920
If you hadn't needed me
as a charm against misfortune,

23:52.070 --> 23:54.750
you would never have brought me back
to the family.

23:54.750 --> 23:57.610
What scheme
could there possibly have been in that?

24:05.510 --> 24:06.590
As a child,

24:07.590 --> 24:09.520
all I ever wanted was to have a home.

24:10.310 --> 24:12.000
But I never imagined

24:12.110 --> 24:14.000
that after finally returning home,

24:14.000 --> 24:14.860
what awaited me

24:15.920 --> 24:17.720
would be nothing but suspicion.

24:22.270 --> 24:24.550
If the real Qingyuan
had spent her life wandering

24:24.550 --> 24:26.010
without anyone to rely on,

24:26.030 --> 24:28.960
she could only blame
her mother for committing murder.

24:28.960 --> 24:30.200
She brought it upon herself.

24:30.200 --> 24:31.070
What? Are you going to

24:31.070 --> 24:33.000
blame Old Madam for kindly sparing

24:33.000 --> 24:34.000
her life back then

24:34.270 --> 24:36.330
and driving her out of the residence?

24:37.070 --> 24:38.680
You're here acting all pitiful,

24:38.680 --> 24:41.440
but you don't seem to realize
we already know the truth—

24:41.440 --> 24:44.350
the real Qingyuan died
in a fire years ago.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.750
You're just an impostor!

24:47.750 --> 24:49.810
Second Madam, why are you framing me?

24:56.640 --> 24:57.640
Father...

25:00.480 --> 25:01.830
They deny who I am,

25:02.720 --> 25:04.270
and you do too?

25:05.350 --> 25:06.200
Child,

25:07.550 --> 25:09.270
I don't want to believe it,

25:10.160 --> 25:11.680
but this is suspicious.

25:12.110 --> 25:15.900
Someone's testified
that you're not my biological daughter.

25:16.240 --> 25:20.920
You must explain this clearly.

25:32.920 --> 25:33.880
Father...

25:35.000 --> 25:37.130
Father, you don't remember me either.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.200
Nine years ago,

25:40.200 --> 25:43.270
on a snowy night, I encountered you.

25:43.720 --> 25:45.440
That was the only time I'd ever

25:47.640 --> 25:48.920
spent with you

25:50.240 --> 25:51.750
since I was a child.

25:55.750 --> 25:57.030
Come on, catch me!

25:57.030 --> 25:57.880
Little Loser,

25:58.030 --> 25:59.280
wait for me!

26:01.000 --> 26:02.110
Come on, catch me!

26:02.200 --> 26:03.570
Little Loser, you...

26:06.300 --> 26:07.430
Whose child are you?

26:11.070 --> 26:12.180
Sir,

26:12.680 --> 26:13.680
I'm sorry.

26:26.160 --> 26:26.880
Little Monkey,

26:26.880 --> 26:28.000
why are you running so slowly?

26:28.000 --> 26:28.680
Come catch me!

26:28.680 --> 26:29.830
Little Loser!

26:30.720 --> 26:31.520
Come catch me!

26:32.070 --> 26:33.690
Stop right there!

26:34.550 --> 26:35.350
Stop!

26:44.110 --> 26:44.830
Father,

26:45.680 --> 26:46.920
don't you remember?

26:54.680 --> 26:58.310
There are countless things from the past.

27:04.350 --> 27:08.590
I really can't remember everything.

27:15.160 --> 27:18.060
Jin Chunqing died in the fire back then.

27:18.200 --> 27:20.760
A fire that even an adult couldn't escape—

27:20.960 --> 27:22.300
how could you, a child,

27:22.510 --> 27:23.780
have escaped it?

27:23.880 --> 27:26.010
I really don't remember how I escaped!

27:26.400 --> 27:27.850
I was so little back then.

27:28.110 --> 27:29.840
How could I possibly remember?

27:31.270 --> 27:33.000
Fourth Madam died in that fire.

27:33.680 --> 27:36.210
Why force Fourth Sister
to dredge up the past?

27:37.160 --> 27:37.640
Mother,

27:38.350 --> 27:40.750
perhaps there's
a misunderstanding in all this.

27:40.750 --> 27:41.720
Stay out of it.

27:49.160 --> 27:49.960
Second Madam,

27:51.790 --> 27:53.310
I know why you've staged

27:53.340 --> 27:54.940
this whole spectacle today.

27:57.030 --> 27:58.360
Because you're scared.

28:01.270 --> 28:03.680
You're afraid I'll expose

28:03.680 --> 28:05.880
what you've concealed all these years.

28:08.070 --> 28:09.000
But today,

28:10.070 --> 28:12.110
it is you who have forced me to reveal it

28:12.110 --> 28:13.310
in front of everyone.

28:15.790 --> 28:16.600
Father,

28:16.880 --> 28:17.680
Grandmother,

28:18.240 --> 28:21.310
my mother didn't kill anyone back then.

28:23.640 --> 28:25.100
The one who used euphorbia

28:25.790 --> 28:28.060
to poison Concubine Xia was her!

28:34.510 --> 28:36.030
I didn't harm Concubine Xia.

28:36.030 --> 28:37.640
Clean up your own mess

28:37.640 --> 28:39.160
before you point the finger at me.

28:39.160 --> 28:41.030
Everything Qingyuan has said

28:42.880 --> 28:44.580
is absolutely true.

28:45.680 --> 28:47.640
Since when do you get a say here?

28:49.510 --> 28:51.700
It's true, I don't get a say,

28:51.830 --> 28:53.200
but I can't bear to watch

28:53.200 --> 28:56.060
Qingyuan suffer wrongful accusations
any longer!

28:57.070 --> 28:57.880
Today, I'll

28:59.000 --> 29:00.330
speak for what is right.

29:02.880 --> 29:04.160
Jin Chunqing

29:05.830 --> 29:07.070
didn't kill her!

29:11.880 --> 29:12.810
What do you mean?

29:13.310 --> 29:14.440
Tell us everything.

29:16.310 --> 29:17.000
Mother,

29:18.510 --> 29:19.270
Master,

29:20.480 --> 29:22.790
I've failed the family.

29:24.240 --> 29:25.970
Back then, it was Concubine Mei

29:26.030 --> 29:27.750
who asked me for euphorbia.

29:52.270 --> 29:54.030
She must've given it to Cui'er.

29:55.270 --> 29:56.110
Cui'er.

29:58.310 --> 29:59.000
Cui'er!

30:01.790 --> 30:02.440
Tell me,

30:03.240 --> 30:04.700
how did Concubine Xia die?

30:08.590 --> 30:09.310
Speak!

30:11.200 --> 30:12.160
It was...

30:14.310 --> 30:17.440
It was Fourth Madam
who gave me a bowl of pregnancy tonic.

30:18.000 --> 30:20.550
I didn't know
it was meant to harm someone.

30:21.830 --> 30:23.310
I never imagined

30:23.640 --> 30:26.790
Concubine Xia
would die so suddenly from it.

30:29.110 --> 30:31.510
And Chunqing was falsely accused of murder

30:31.510 --> 30:33.310
and driven out of the household.

30:34.680 --> 30:36.160
I was too weak.

30:36.350 --> 30:39.640
I never dared tell anyone the truth.

30:40.070 --> 30:41.270
All these years,

30:41.750 --> 30:43.810
I've lived with a guilty conscience,

30:43.920 --> 30:46.720
tormented by it day and night.

30:47.880 --> 30:48.960
But thankfully...

30:49.270 --> 30:50.930
Thankfully, Heaven sees all.

30:51.350 --> 30:53.310
Qingyuan's return to the household

30:53.310 --> 30:55.770
finally gave me the chance
to tell the truth.

30:58.830 --> 30:59.590
Father,

31:00.680 --> 31:01.480
Grandmother,

31:02.440 --> 31:03.310
a few days ago,

31:03.590 --> 31:05.310
Third Madam and I
had a small get-together.

31:05.310 --> 31:06.640
She drank too much

31:06.960 --> 31:09.720
and let the truth about
what happened back then slip out.

31:09.720 --> 31:10.740
Somehow,

31:11.310 --> 31:13.110
it reached Second Madam's ears.

31:13.880 --> 31:14.680
Second Madam

31:15.070 --> 31:17.270
then came up with this charade today.

31:18.750 --> 31:20.750
She wants me to end up like my mother—

31:20.790 --> 31:22.320
driven out of the household

31:22.550 --> 31:24.240
and bearing a bad name
for the rest of my life,

31:24.240 --> 31:25.900
with nowhere to seek justice!

31:30.270 --> 31:32.510
Now that the truth
has finally come to light,

31:32.510 --> 31:33.130
Father,

31:35.440 --> 31:36.240
Grandmother,

31:38.110 --> 31:40.110
you must seek justice for my mother.

31:40.350 --> 31:41.000
Without any proof,

31:41.000 --> 31:42.550
what justice are you talking about?

31:42.550 --> 31:43.400
I didn't harm Fourth Madam

31:43.400 --> 31:44.550
and Fifth Madam.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.880
W-Why

31:48.510 --> 31:50.160
are you all staring at me?

31:51.350 --> 31:53.610
W-Why don't you say something about her?

31:57.310 --> 31:59.310
A-Are you out of your mind?

31:59.440 --> 32:01.840
Why drag me into your mess?

32:01.860 --> 32:03.930
You told me about the euphorbia!

32:06.750 --> 32:08.110
What are you talking about?

32:08.110 --> 32:09.270
Enough, all of you!

32:11.550 --> 32:13.730
What a cursed family.

32:15.550 --> 32:16.420
Second Madam,

32:16.480 --> 32:19.810
you claim I'm not Father's daughter.

32:20.270 --> 32:21.640
Do you have any proof?

32:23.680 --> 32:25.790
If those stories you made up

32:25.790 --> 32:26.850
count as evidence,

32:27.880 --> 32:31.110
then what Third Madam just testified

32:31.720 --> 32:33.270
is enough to send you to prison

32:33.270 --> 32:35.000
and make you pay with your life!

32:35.030 --> 32:35.750
If you're so sure of yourself,

32:35.750 --> 32:36.950
let's see your proof!

32:39.640 --> 32:41.270
This Xie Residence is

32:41.480 --> 32:43.030
so lively again today.

32:48.030 --> 32:48.890
You two, get up.

32:52.750 --> 32:55.310
I've failed in managing my family.

32:55.920 --> 32:58.200
Servants and womenfolk are making a scene,

32:58.200 --> 33:00.200
bringing shame upon the household,

33:00.640 --> 33:03.880
and there isn't a shred of propriety left.

33:04.270 --> 33:05.550
Lord Yan, no wonder

33:05.550 --> 33:08.510
you can come and go
in my residence freely,

33:08.510 --> 33:10.970
as if walking through unguarded territory.

33:11.200 --> 33:13.000
You put it too strongly, Lord Xie.

33:13.000 --> 33:14.720
We both serve the Emperor.

33:15.000 --> 33:17.530
Aren't we practically family
in that regard?

33:20.510 --> 33:22.400
On this fine day,

33:22.720 --> 33:24.440
I've prepared

33:24.550 --> 33:26.280
a great gift for everyone here.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.880
What kind of gift?

33:29.640 --> 33:30.550
Men,

33:31.180 --> 33:32.040
bring the gift!

33:36.550 --> 33:39.310
Last night, I caught a thief

33:39.310 --> 33:41.040
who works for your household.

33:41.350 --> 33:42.200
Second Madam, save me.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.000
Chuntai?

33:43.830 --> 33:45.160
-You...
-Second Madam.

33:45.310 --> 33:46.590
From now on,

33:46.920 --> 33:48.320
you'd better be careful.

33:48.400 --> 33:50.790
You should know,
"The hardest thief to guard against

33:50.790 --> 33:52.520
is the one under your own roof."

33:53.240 --> 33:54.720
You little thing,

33:54.720 --> 33:55.590
haven't I treated you well enough?

33:55.590 --> 33:56.640
Yet you stole money?

33:56.640 --> 33:57.790
I really didn't steal money.

33:57.790 --> 34:00.320
I was just delivering money
for Second Madam.

34:02.750 --> 34:04.550
D-Delivering what money?

34:05.070 --> 34:07.000
I never asked you to deliver money!

34:07.920 --> 34:09.850
Second Young Master, your letter.

34:10.030 --> 34:11.110
Read it out loud.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.360
"Respectfully to Madam,

34:17.360 --> 34:18.670
at 7:45 tonight.

34:18.730 --> 34:19.920
Do you still remember

34:19.920 --> 34:21.400
your old acquaintance, Cui'er?

34:21.400 --> 34:24.760
Please prepare 50 taels of silver
by tomorrow night.

34:25.360 --> 34:27.420
Otherwise, we all go down together."

34:31.070 --> 34:32.440
Who is Cui'er?

34:32.960 --> 34:34.280
What right does she have to demand

34:34.280 --> 34:35.550
50 taels of silver from my mother
by tomorrow night?

34:35.550 --> 34:37.440
"Otherwise, we all go down together"?

34:37.440 --> 34:38.969
She's threatening Mother!

34:39.440 --> 34:40.880
Second Young Master, please calm down.

34:40.880 --> 34:42.540
I'll go find Second Madam now.

35:02.190 --> 35:03.320
Thank you, Lord Yan,

35:03.360 --> 35:05.360
for bringing the evidence I wanted.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.200
Are you okay?

35:26.480 --> 35:27.010
I'm fine.

35:30.000 --> 35:31.550
Father, Grandmother,

35:32.510 --> 35:34.710
my dear friend can leave now, can't she?

35:38.230 --> 35:38.920
Go.

35:40.550 --> 35:41.080
Quickly.

36:03.190 --> 36:04.110
Let go of me!

36:05.510 --> 36:06.300
Let go of me!

36:06.590 --> 36:07.510
Let me go!

36:07.760 --> 36:08.880
Let go of me!

36:09.000 --> 36:11.800
-Fourth Lady Xie, are you satisfied?
-Let go of me!

36:12.400 --> 36:14.060
-Thank you, Lord Yan.
-Let go!

36:17.070 --> 36:18.030
Lord Yan.

36:19.920 --> 36:23.710
I thank you for bringing

36:24.110 --> 36:26.550
this thieving maidservant

36:27.230 --> 36:28.560
to our household today.

36:28.920 --> 36:31.050
My Lord, if you have no other business,

36:31.150 --> 36:34.630
we shouldn't keep you
from your official duties.

36:35.320 --> 36:36.150
Not at all.

36:36.710 --> 36:38.110
With such a brilliant show,

36:38.110 --> 36:40.630
how could I possibly leave
before seeing the ending?

36:40.630 --> 36:42.830
So, Old Madam, please don't rush me off.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.760
Fourth Lady Xie, just now, you said

36:48.400 --> 36:49.930
this woman is your witness.

36:50.480 --> 36:53.670
Doesn't that mean
you're in the know as well?

36:57.280 --> 36:58.610
Lord Yan, you're right.

36:58.960 --> 37:01.510
I wrote the letter Chuntai received.

37:02.190 --> 37:03.000
I used the identity of Cui'er,

37:03.000 --> 37:05.110
the medicine servant
who once attended my mother,

37:05.110 --> 37:07.320
to write the blackmail letter
to Second Madam.

37:07.320 --> 37:08.030
Cui'er

37:08.510 --> 37:09.760
was the only witness
who testified against my mother

37:09.760 --> 37:10.960
for murder back then.

37:11.840 --> 37:13.000
I wrote that letter

37:13.230 --> 37:14.800
not for money,

37:15.190 --> 37:17.110
but to set a trap

37:17.510 --> 37:20.480
and lure out the real murderer.

37:23.670 --> 37:25.190
Mei Yinghua,

37:25.710 --> 37:27.070
how dare you!

37:31.070 --> 37:32.360
You ungrateful wretch,

37:32.360 --> 37:33.620
who gave you the nerve?

37:34.070 --> 37:35.800
You committed such a grave offense
out of your own selfishness,

37:35.800 --> 37:37.640
and now you drag me into it?

37:39.320 --> 37:40.780
I was wrong, Second Madam.

37:40.960 --> 37:41.710
Chuntai,

37:42.150 --> 37:43.070
don't be afraid.

37:43.070 --> 37:45.000
Who exactly ordered you to do that?

37:45.070 --> 37:46.070
Tell us the truth.

37:50.320 --> 37:51.630
Whatever wrongdoing Chuntai committed,

37:51.630 --> 37:53.670
you may judge and punish her
as you see fit—

37:53.670 --> 37:55.230
why pin it on me?

37:56.280 --> 37:57.320
Besides,

37:57.550 --> 37:59.090
we still haven't found out

37:59.190 --> 38:00.760
whether the "Qingyuan" here
is real or an impostor!

38:00.760 --> 38:01.360
Enough!

38:03.150 --> 38:04.530
With Lord Yan here,

38:05.230 --> 38:07.090
you still dare act so insolently?

38:14.880 --> 38:15.630
Fine then.

38:16.920 --> 38:18.320
I'll decide this myself.

38:18.840 --> 38:19.590
Donglin.

38:22.190 --> 38:24.370
Drag this wretched maid away

38:24.590 --> 38:26.150
and punish her according to family rules!

38:26.150 --> 38:27.010
Yes, Old Madam.

38:27.510 --> 38:28.000
No...

38:28.360 --> 38:29.670
Second Madam, save me.

38:29.670 --> 38:30.590
I didn't steal money.

38:30.590 --> 38:32.390
Second Madam, save me.

38:32.590 --> 38:34.840
Second Madam, please save me!

38:34.840 --> 38:35.880
Second Madam!

38:43.110 --> 38:43.760
Is that it?

38:45.110 --> 38:47.310
Your Xie family is really interesting.

38:47.400 --> 38:50.260
I thought it'd be just
a petty household case today.

38:50.630 --> 38:52.550
I didn't expect it to turn into

38:52.630 --> 38:54.760
a serious case involving human lives.

38:55.440 --> 38:56.550
What should we do now,

38:56.550 --> 38:57.480
Lord Xie?

39:02.030 --> 39:03.760
It's not that complicated.

39:04.710 --> 39:06.570
Lord Yan, you've misunderstood.

39:06.920 --> 39:10.720
These are merely trivial matters
between the women in my household.

39:10.880 --> 39:12.800
When my wife, concubines, and daughters

39:12.800 --> 39:14.400
get into it with one another,

39:14.510 --> 39:16.640
it's always a matter of life and death.

39:16.920 --> 39:21.070
As they say, even immortals
can't settle family disputes.

39:23.110 --> 39:25.510
Fourth Madam's case back then

39:25.960 --> 39:28.020
was already settled beyond dispute.

39:28.440 --> 39:30.320
Now, the matter of a few servant girls

39:30.320 --> 39:32.450
is simply a trivial household matter.

39:32.960 --> 39:35.110
I can handle it myself perfectly well.

39:35.480 --> 39:37.610
You needn't concern yourself with it.

39:57.630 --> 39:58.590
Come on, hurry!

39:58.920 --> 39:59.960
Tie them tighter!

40:00.960 --> 40:01.800
Secure them well!

40:01.800 --> 40:02.670
Be careful.

40:03.800 --> 40:04.600
And over here!

40:05.510 --> 40:06.510
Come on, let's go!

40:09.920 --> 40:10.550
Hurry up!

40:12.440 --> 40:13.280
Lord Wei,

40:14.030 --> 40:15.480
I've delivered all the grain to you.

40:15.480 --> 40:16.540
Where's the money?

40:16.760 --> 40:18.020
Don't be so impatient.

40:18.760 --> 40:21.490
The drum atop the city tower
has already sounded.

40:21.960 --> 40:22.960
The money

40:23.400 --> 40:24.600
will be here shortly.

40:27.190 --> 40:28.070
Master,

40:28.550 --> 40:30.150
the drum atop the city tower is sounding.

40:30.150 --> 40:32.150
Something major must be happening.

40:34.510 --> 40:35.480
Today is the eighth—

40:35.480 --> 40:37.510
the day the court collects the grain.

40:37.510 --> 40:38.230
Wrong.

40:40.280 --> 40:42.630
That's not the signal
for grain collection.

40:42.630 --> 40:44.190
It's an imperial order

40:44.190 --> 40:46.190
to open the granaries
and distribute grain.

40:46.190 --> 40:47.360
Distribute grain?

40:48.190 --> 40:50.450
Aren't you supposed to be collecting it?

40:51.630 --> 40:52.920
By order of Lord Yan,

40:52.940 --> 40:54.320
open the granaries and distribute grain!

40:54.320 --> 40:55.560
By order of Lord Yan,

40:55.630 --> 40:57.400
open the granaries and distribute grain!

40:57.400 --> 40:58.070
That's the sound of grain distribution.

40:58.070 --> 40:59.330
By order of Lord Yan...

40:59.350 --> 40:59.710
Really?

40:59.710 --> 41:01.280
Open the granaries and distribute grain!

41:01.280 --> 41:03.540
That's the sound of grain distribution!

41:04.670 --> 41:05.800
That's impossible!

41:06.440 --> 41:08.600
The government granaries are empty.

41:08.800 --> 41:10.800
Where would the grain even come from?

41:10.800 --> 41:12.000
The grain's arrived!

41:12.840 --> 41:14.000
It's really arrived! It's really here!

41:14.000 --> 41:15.000
Right over there!

41:15.480 --> 41:16.590
Hurry, hurry!

41:28.960 --> 41:29.890
What did you say?

41:31.590 --> 41:32.760
Distribute grain?

41:33.760 --> 41:34.760
Impossible!

41:35.320 --> 41:36.590
What grain could they possibly distribute?

41:36.590 --> 41:37.760
They don't have any grain.

41:37.760 --> 41:39.760
So what grain
could he possibly distribute?

41:39.760 --> 41:40.760
Whose grain is it?

41:41.320 --> 41:41.880
My Lord,

41:42.030 --> 41:45.690
the grain you collected has all been
distributed to the refugees.

41:50.170 --> 41:51.230
Where's the money?

41:52.480 --> 41:54.000
I'm asking you—where's the money?

41:54.000 --> 41:54.710
Money?

41:54.840 --> 41:56.010
There's no money.
